<title>GERMANY: FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - German ZEW data on 6-month growth trend.</headline>
<dateline>MANNHEIM, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following table gives data on expectations of growth and industry trends for the six months from May 1997 issued by the ZEW Zentrum fuer Europaeische Wirtschaftsforschung GmbH research institute.</p>
<p>The percentage figures are compiled from a survey of 285 firms conducted from May 5 to May 20. Figures in brackets show the change from April's survey.</p>
